tel 1.0

name fuel

# The format of Fuel's configuration, `.pyrocosm/fuel/config.tel`: `Workspace.schema` reads
# this file, and holds each `section` of a configuration to it. A member which may be written
# as an atom on its keyword's line, or as a child beneath it, is listed before those which may
# not, since atoms are assigned to members in order: `section guide doc` is a section whose
# `name` is `guide` and whose `path` is `doc`.

record Translation
  description
      A translation of a section into one language: the language, as `fr` or `pt-BR`, and
      the directory, within the section's, which mirrors the directory of its original text,
      a file's translation being the file of the same path there. `fallback` is the language
      which is read where this one has no file: another the section is translated into, or
      the one it is written in.
  field language String
  field path String
  field fallback String optional

record Original
  description
      The text a section is written in, which its translations translate: its language, and
      its directory within the section's. `metadata` is the file, within that directory,
      which says what a reader is told of the section, to the schema `section`; each
      `overlay` is a directory of the API's documentation, and each `glossary` a file of
      terms, within it too.
  field language String
  field path String
  field metadata String optional
  field overlay String optional repeatable
  field glossary String optional repeatable

record Section
  description
      A section of documents: its name, which the address of each of its documents begins
      with, and its directory within the project's. It holds its original text, and a
      translation for each other language it is read in.
  field name String
  field path String
  field original Original
  field translation Translation optional repeatable

record Sync
  description
      A tracker whose open issues the API's pages show: its kind, as `github`, and what it
      tracks, as `propensive/fuel`.
  field tracker String
  field repository String

document
  field section Section optional repeatable
  field classpath String optional repeatable
  field scalac-option String optional repeatable
  field session Flag optional
  field fixtures String optional
  field source String optional repeatable
  field overlay String optional repeatable
  field schema String optional repeatable
  field imports String optional repeatable
  field glossary String optional repeatable
  field check-links Flag optional
  field output String optional
  field sync Sync optional repeatable
  field present-port String optional
  field serve Flag optional
  field port String optional
